+/*************************************************************************/ /*!
+@File
+@Title          OS Interface for mapping PMRs into CPU space.
+@Copyright      Copyright (c) Imagination Technologies Ltd. All Rights Reserved
+@Description    OS abstraction for the mmap2 interface for mapping PMRs into
+                User Mode memory
