+/*!
+*******************************************************************************
+
+ @Function      PMRUnmakeLocalImportHandle
+
+ @Description
+
+ Take a PMR, destroy the handle and release a reference.
+ Counterpart to PMRMakeServerExportClientExport().
+
+ @Input   psPMR       PMR to destroy.
+                      Created by PMRMakeLocalImportHandle().
+
+ @Return   PVRSRV_ERROR
+
+******************************************************************************/
