@@ -0,0 +1,278 @@
+/**************************************************************************/ /*!
+@File
+@Title          Fence sync server interface
+@Copyright      Copyright (c) Imagination Technologies Ltd. All Rights Reserved
+@License        Dual MIT/GPLv2
+
+The contents of this file are subject to the MIT license as set out below.
