+ *  +-----|------------|-+           +-|------------|-----+                  *
+ *        |            |               |            |                        *
+ *        |            |               |            |                        *
+ *        |            |               |            |                        *
+ *        |            |               |            |                        *
+ *        |            | KM-ptr        | KM-ptr     |                        *
+ *        |            V               V            |                        *
+ *        |      +==========================+       |                        *
